local-llm-mcp

This program is a modified version of OllamaClaude by Jadael
(https://github.com/Jadael/OllamaClaude), an MCP server that lets Claude Code use a
local Ollama server. The original is licensed under the GNU Affero General Public
License v3.0, and so is this program (AGPL-3.0-only; see LICENSE). The original's code
and history up to 2025-10-24 are part of this repository's git history.

Modifications: since 2026-08-18 this repository has been substantially modified by
Holger Reinhardt (https://github.com/hlgr360). Among other changes it was generalised
from a local Ollama server to any OpenAI-compatible server (llama.cpp's llama-server,
vLLM, LM Studio) and to any MCP-speaking coding agent. The changes are listed in
CHANGELOG.md and in the git history, with dates.

The original copyright notices and licence terms of the upstream project continue to
apply to the parts derived from it.
